# cell-set updates the value; cell-get reads the new value

[
  cell: [builtin-reactive-cell 1]
  _:    [builtin-cell-set 99 cell]
]
[builtin-cell-get cell]
=== out
Int(99)

=== warn
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: builtin-reactive-cell
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: builtin-cell-set
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: builtin-cell-get
